   "stem": {
      "text": "Find the sum of the series \\( \\sum_{n=2}^{\\infty} \\frac{7 (-1)^{n} \\left(x + 2\\right)^{n}}{2^{n}} \\) as a closed-form expression in x, for the values of x where the series converges.",
